---
title: The Pusheen Cult
layout: "base.njk"
nesting: "./"
---

<div class="content-box py-5 px-5 rounded-box-bottom shadow-sm form-page">
    <div class="w-100">
        <h2>The Lord is listening</h2>
        <p>
          The Lord is always listening. Send your prayers and she may respond.
          <br/>
          Alternatively, you can also send in your testimonials to us <b><a href="{{ '/testimonials/' | url }}">here</a></b>.
        </p>
        <div class="form mb-5">
            <div>
                <label class="form-heading"
              >Name <span class="red-text">*</span></label
            >
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <input type="text" id="name-input" class="form-text-input"/>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3">
                <label class="form-heading"
              >Email</label
            >
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <input
              type="email"
              id="email-input"
              class="form-text-input"
/>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3 mb-2">
                <label class="form-heading"
              >Message <span class="red-text">*</span></label
            >
            </div>
            <div>
                <textarea class="form-text-input message-box"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4">
                <button class="submit-btn">Submit</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>